{
  "schema_version": "report-evidence/1",
  "source_sha256": "e989661b6b83ddc44984be1f8a6adc17542e16e86f12c9f9a1a018dac3ea169e",
  "fragments": [
    {
      "id": "e_e989661b6b83_0001",
      "text": "Blacklisted users can call unstake() and lock the funds in the adapter forever.",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 79,
      "line": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e989661b6b83_0002",
      "text": "## Finding description and impact",
      "start": 81,
      "end": 114,
      "line": 3
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e989661b6b83_0003",
      "text": "``_beforeTokenTransfer()`` in ``iTryTokenOFT.sol`` prevents ``blacklisted`` users from transferring any token:",
      "start": 116,
      "end": 226,
      "line": 5
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e989661b6b83_0004",
      "text": "https://github.com/code-423n4/2025-11-brix-money/blob/68bf3dcb7105a1b0ed88b97a57691b0a6230e4e9/src/token/iTRY/crosschain/iTryTokenOFT.sol#L139-L177",
      "start": 228,
      "end": 375,
      "line": 7
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e989661b6b83_0005",
      "text": "``unstake()`` on ``unstakeMessenger.sol`` can be called even by ``blacklisted`` users.",
      "start": 377,
      "end": 463,
      "line": 9
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e989661b6b83_0006",
      "text": "https://github.com/code-423n4/2025-11-brix-money/blob/68bf3dcb7105a1b0ed88b97a57691b0a6230e4e9/src/token/wiTRY/crosschain/UnstakeMessenger.sol#L108-L151",
      "start": 465,
      "end": 617,
      "line": 11
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e989661b6b83_0007",
      "text": "The whole flow works as follows:",
      "start": 619,
      "end": 651,
      "line": 13
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e989661b6b83_0008",
      "text": "1. Blacklisted user Alice completes cooldown for ``100`` iTRY tokens.",
      "start": 652,
      "end": 721,
      "line": 14
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e989661b6b83_0009",
      "text": "2. Alice calls ``UnstakeMessenger.unstake(0.05 ETH)``",
      "start": 722,
      "end": 775,
      "line": 15
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e989661b6b83_0010",
      "text": "- Pays 0.1 ETH total (0.05 for spoke→hub, 0.05 for return) │",
      "start": 782,
      "end": 842,
      "line": 16
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e989661b6b83_0011",
      "text": "- Message: UnstakeMessage({user: Alice, ...})               │",
      "start": 847,
      "end": 908,
      "line": 17
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e989661b6b83_0012",
      "text": "- LayerZero message sent to hub",
      "start": 913,
      "end": 944,
      "line": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e989661b6b83_0013",
      "text": "3. LayerZero Endpoint calls ``wiTryVaultComposer._lzReceive()``",
      "start": 949,
      "end": 1012,
      "line": 19
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e989661b6b83_0014",
      "text": "4. ``_lzReceive()`` decodes message and calls ``_handleUnstake()``",
      "start": 1013,
      "end": 1079,
      "line": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e989661b6b83_0015",
      "text": "5. StakediTryCrosschain.unstakeThroughComposer(Alice) is called",
      "start": 1080,
      "end": 1143,
      "line": 21
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e989661b6b83_0016",
      "text": "6. ``_handleUnstake()`` continues",
      "start": 1144,
      "end": 1177,
      "line": 22
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e989661b6b83_0017",
      "text": "7. ``iTryTokenOFTAdapter.send()`` is called",
      "start": 1178,
      "end": 1221,
      "line": 23
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e989661b6b83_0018",
      "text": "8. LayerZero Endpoint delivers message",
      "start": 1222,
      "end": 1260,
      "line": 24
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e989661b6b83_0019",
      "text": "- Calls: iTryTokenOFT._lzReceive()",
      "start": 1266,
      "end": 1300,
      "line": 25
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e989661b6b83_0020",
      "text": "9. ``iTryTokenOFT._lzReceive()`` executes:",
      "start": 1301,
      "end": 1343,
      "line": 26
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e989661b6b83_0021",
      "text": "10. ``_credit()`` calls ``_mint()``",
      "start": 1344,
      "end": 1379,
      "line": 27
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e989661b6b83_0022",
      "text": "11. ``_mint()`` triggers ``_beforeTokenTransfer()`` which ``reverts()``.",
      "start": 1380,
      "end": 1452,
      "line": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e989661b6b83_0023",
      "text": "This is how ``unstake()`` of ``unstakeMessenger.sol`` calls ``_beforeTokenTransfer()`` on ``iTryTokenOFT.sol``.",
      "start": 1454,
      "end": 1565,
      "line": 30
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e989661b6b83_0024",
      "text": "Now the main problem is when our ``_credit()`` fails due to ``blacklisted``,  our ``100 iTRY`` tokens are still locked in ``iTryTokenOFTAdapter()`` with no ``rescue`` mechanism.",
      "start": 1567,
      "end": 1744,
      "line": 32
    }
  ]
}
